{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"申命記","commonName":"申命記","title":"申命記","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"5c99d640766f4ea11b4ca8e01cfd5ad9c5deadc5b6eb8918cde0bde55312a45e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":949},"chapter":{"number":32,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「諸天啊，請聽我說；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地啊，請聽我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願我的教導如雨降下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願我的話語如露滴落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像水滴滋潤嫩草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像甘霖澆灌草木。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要宣揚耶和華的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要頌讚我們上帝的偉大。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"「祂是磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的作為完美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂按公義行事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂信實可靠，公平正直。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狡詐、墮落的一代啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們卻對祂不忠，行事敗壞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不配做祂的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚昧無知的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們就這樣報答耶和華嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是你們的父，你們的創造主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂創造了你們，塑造了你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"「要回顧往昔，追溯歷史；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"問你們的父親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必回答你們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"問你們的長者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必告訴你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當初，至高者賜萬國產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把人類分開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂依照天使","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"的數目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為萬族定疆界。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但以色列人屬於耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各是祂的產業。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「在荒涼的曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在野獸吼叫的荒野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華找到他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"庇護他們，看顧他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"保護他們如同保護眼中的瞳人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如老鷹攪動窩巢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盤旋在雛鷹之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"展開雙翼接住牠們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背著他們飛翔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華獨自帶領他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有外族神明同在。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華使他們馳騁在大地的高處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃田間的五穀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"磐石中的蜂蜜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"石頭地產的油；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃牛酪和羊奶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"肥美的羔羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊的綿羊和山羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上好的麥子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝葡萄汁釀的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"「但耶書崙","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"吃飽喝足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"養肥長壯後，就得意忘形，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背棄造他們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐視救他們的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們拜外族的神明，令祂憤恨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行可憎之事，惹祂發怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們祭拜的不是真神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是鬼魔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是他們素不認識的新神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是他們祖先所不敬畏的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們輕視生他們的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘記養他們的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華看見祂兒女的惡行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就憤然厭棄他們，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說，『這墮落的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不忠的兒女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要掩面不理他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看他們的結局如何。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們拜假神，讓我憤恨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"供虛無之物，惹我發怒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要藉無名之民挑起他們的嫉妒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用愚昧的國民激起他們的怒氣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的怒火已經點燃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要燒到陰間的盡頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞滅大地及其出產，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至燒毀山的根基。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"「『我要使災禍連連臨到他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的箭都射向他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必飽受饑荒之苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被瘟疫和災禍吞噬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被猛獸和毒蛇襲擊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外有刀劍殺戮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"內有恐懼籠罩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"男女老幼無不喪命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我本要消滅他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使世人忘記他們；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我怕敵人誇口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誤以為這是他們的勝利，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而非我的作為。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"「以色列人愚昧無知，毫無見識。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果他們有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就能明白這一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道自己的結局。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是他們的磐石賣掉他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是耶和華拋棄他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一人怎能趕散他們千人？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二人怎能擊潰他們萬人？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的敵人也承認他們的磐石不如我們的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們猶如來自所多瑪、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長在蛾摩拉的葡萄樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"結的葡萄粒粒有毒，串串苦澀；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"釀的酒如蛇的毒液，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如眼鏡蛇的毒液。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"text":"「祂說，『我把這一切積存起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"封在我的倉庫裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伸冤在我，我必報應，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到時候他們必站不住腳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭禍的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的末日快要來了。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華見自己的子民力量衰竭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奴隸和自由人所剩無幾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必為他們主持公道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憐憫祂的僕人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必說，『你們的神明在哪裡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"庇護你們的磐石在哪裡？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們吃你們祭牲的脂肪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝你們的奠酒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓它們起來幫助你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"庇護你們吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"text":"「『你們現今要知道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有我是上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我之外，別無他神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我掌管生死，我打傷、我醫治；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能逃出我的掌心。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向天伸手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憑我的永恆起誓，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要磨快閃亮的劍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主持公道，報應仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懲罰恨我的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我的箭飽飲鮮血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是被殺被擄之人的血；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的劍要吞噬人肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是敵人將領的肉。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"text":"「列邦啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當與祂的子民一同歡樂！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂要為自己的僕人報血仇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報應祂的仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"潔淨祂的土地和子民。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":["摩西和嫩的兒子約書亞把這首詩歌讀給會眾聽。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["摩西的遺囑"]},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":["讀完後，摩西又對以色列人說："]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":["「要謹記我今天警告你們的話，要吩咐你們的子孫謹遵這律法上的一切話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":["這律法不是空話，而是你們的生命。你們若遵守這律法，就必長住在約旦河西岸你們將要佔領的土地上。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["預言摩西的死"]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":["當天，耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":["「你去耶利哥對面的摩押，登上亞巴琳山區的尼波山，觀看我要賜給以色列人作產業的迦南。"]},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":["之後，你會死在那山上，歸到你祖先那裡，如你哥哥亞倫在何珥山離世歸祖一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":["因為在荀曠野，在加低斯的米利巴泉旁，你和亞倫對我不忠，沒有在以色列人中尊我為聖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":["所以，你只能遠遠地觀看我要賜給以色列人的土地，卻不能進去。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"「天使」希伯來文是「以色列的兒子」。","reference":{"chapter":32,"verse":8}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"「耶書崙」是以色列的暱稱。","reference":{"chapter":32,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/32.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/33.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":52}